Package: gtk-4-bin
Version: @DEB_LIBGTK4_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.gtk.org/
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (= @DEB_LIBGTK4_V@), libglib2.0-bin, libgtkintl
Description: Programs for the GTK 4 graphical user interface library
 GTK is a multi-platform toolkit for creating graphical user interfaces.
 .
 This package contains the program tools shipped with GTK 4, such as
 gtk4-update-icon-cache, gtk4-query-settings, gtk4-builder-tool and
 gtk4-launch.
